# Agent transcripts are NOT published.
#
# A Benzi transcript records every tool call together with its RESULT, and those
# results are the index's output verbatim -- its card format, identifier scheme
# and field set. That is the design of the product, not evidence about the
# benchmark, so it stays private. Most recorded Benzi traces contain it.
#
# The run log (results/runs.jsonl) carries the measurements and none of those
# shapes; it was scanned before publishing and contains no internal field names.
# That difference is what makes the log publishable and the transcripts not.
#
# Blanket-ignored rather than listed file by file, so a future `git add -A`
# cannot sweep in a new transcript by accident.
results/transcripts/
*_benzi.jsonl
*_control.jsonl
*_opencode.jsonl

# Working repositories, worktrees and generated pages
repos/
wt/
*.html
pagedata.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
